      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jerome, Marco: What is the maximum value of `num_sbs` in VP9?\n\nIn 32-bits, `size_t` is an unsigned 32-bit integer. So simply casting `num_sbs` to `size_t` won\u0027t help in 32-bit build. To support 32-bit builds, we need to check for overflow in these three operatiohns.",
      "revId": "042aebc99d382a367f22414558258be7d744167e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
