      "message": "Among these three constants, `DQCOEFFS_PER_SB_LOG2` is the most problematic. Therefore, if we can left-shift by `DQCOEFFS_PER_SB_LOG2` without overflow, the other two operations won\u0027t overflow. So it suffices to just check the first operation for overflow as I suggested above.",
